      " CSIT Congress 2026 in Aalborg\n\n### \n\n* [![](http://kowsc.or.kr/data/file/news/thumb-547a3cd47dfb738b599bfd6e3516caff_rFHoAwNI_32cf96902e86c77e072516abd2d5af7c3f9c46d4_600x782.jpg)](http://kowsc.or.kr/bbs/view_image.php?bo_table=news&fn=547a3cd47dfb738b599bfd6e3516caff_rFHoAwNI_32cf96902e86c77e072516abd2d5af7c3f9c46d4.jpg)\n\nTo all CSIT Member Unions,\nDear Presidents and General Secretaries,\nTo all the members of the CSIT Executive Committee,\nTo Chairmen and Secretaries of Technical Commissions,\nTo Partners of CSIT,\n\n \nThe city of Aalborg is delighted to invite you to the **48th CONGRESS** of the **CSIT** **\\- International Workers and Amateurs in Sports Confederation**, an ordinary Congress, held **from October 12th to 18th, 2026 in Aalborg / Denmark**, the host city of the [IX. CSIT World Sports Games 2027](https://www.csit.sport/events/wsg/2027).\n\n \nThe official invitation of the congress as well as the registration form can be found in the attachment.\n\n \nThank you very much and in case of further questions, please do not hesitate to contact our colleagues from Aalborg or the CSIT Office anytime.\n\n \n\n \n\n \nYours sincerely,\nMeilleures salutations,\n\n \n\n \n**Wolfgang Burghardt**\n\n \nSecretary General\nSecrétaire Général\n\n \nPhone: +43 676 847464 25\n\n \n**CSIT**\nInternational Workers\nand Amateurs in Sports\nConfederation\n\n \nConfédération Sportive\nInternationale Travailliste\net Amateur\n\n \nSteinergasse 12,\n1230 Vienna,\n\nAUSTRIA\n\n을 작성해 주세요."
